  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0068_7a9ca05d2635.png\" style=\"width: 230px; height: 169px;\" /></p><p>For hanging block,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>40</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, maximum value of friction force will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>02</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math></p><p>For block on table,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>From equation(1) and equation (2), we get<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>32</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>44</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>32</mn><mn>44</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>11</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math></p>"
